From 5a937bb49caf2bd7b95f9c500dd91dfe4c04c0ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritvik <ritvik2014@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:44:51 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 33/40] screenshot UI: draw on the shot, save folders, copy its
 text or a colour

d draws on the selection (area, window or screen): pen, line, arrow, box,
oval, highlighter, text and redaction (p s a r o m i x), colours 1-8, sizes
[ ], by mouse or by keys (hjkl move a cursor, v starts and ends a shape, i
types), u/Ctrl+r undo/redo; y/Enter take it with the drawing. f picks the
folder Enter saves to (screenshot-path's, then ~/.config/niri/
screenshot-folders or Desktop/Downloads/Pictures). o copies the selection's
text (tesseract | wl-copy), c the colour under the pointer.
